title: 命令模式与轨迹记录
tags: 竞技场咏唱设计模式 AI生成

!! 命令模式在咏唱中的作用

命令模式记录咏唱过程中的 API 调用轨迹，支持服务端重放验证。每个命令产生一个签名，记录输入类型、输出类型和操作名称；命令轨迹用于证明调用序列可复现。

!! 核心接口

```ts
export interface ChantCommand {
  readonly name: string;
  execute(input: ChantCommandInput): Promise<ChantCommandOutput>;
}

export interface ChantCommandBus {
  run(command: ChantCommand, input: ChantCommandInput): Promise<ChantCommandOutput>;
  getTrace(): ChantCommandTrace[];
}
```

!! 具体命令

读取档案片段：

```ts
export class ReadArchiveCommand implements ChantCommand {
  readonly name = 'readArchive';

  constructor(private verseSource: VerseSource) {}

  async execute(input: ChantCommandInput): Promise<ChantCommandOutput> {
    const fragment = await this.verseSource.nextVerse(input.route.seed);

    return {
      ...input,
      fragments: [...input.fragments, fragment],
    };
  }
}
```

绑定索引范围：

```ts
export class BindIndexCommand implements ChantCommand {
  readonly name = 'bindIndex';

  constructor(private index: IndexApi) {}

  async execute(input: ChantCommandInput): Promise<ChantCommandOutput> {
    const citation = await this.index.bindPageRange({
      fragment: input.latestFragment(),
      range: input.route.indexRange,
    });

    return {
      ...input,
      citations: [...input.citations, citation],
    };
  }
}
```

!! 轨迹记录实现

```ts
export class TracedChantCommandBus implements ChantCommandBus {
  private trace: ChantCommandTrace[] = [];

  constructor(private logger: ChantLogger) {}

  async run(
    command: ChantCommand,
    input: ChantCommandInput,
  ): Promise<ChantCommandOutput> {
    const startedAt = performance.now();

    try {
      const output = await command.execute(input);

      this.trace.push({
        command: command.name,
        ok: true,
        durationMs: performance.now() - startedAt,
        inputType: typeOfOpaque(input),
        outputType: typeOfOpaque(output),
      });

      return output;
    } catch (error) {
      this.trace.push({
        command: command.name,
        ok: false,
        durationMs: performance.now() - startedAt,
        error: String(error),
      });
      throw error;
    }
  }

  getTrace(): ChantCommandTrace[] {
    return this.trace;
  }
}
```

!! 签名中的命令信息

```ts
export interface CommandSignature extends ChantSignature {
  kind: 'commandTrace';
  evidence: {
    commandName: string;
    durationMs: number;
    inputType: string;
    outputType: string;
  };
}
```

!! 使用示例

```ts
const bus = new TracedChantCommandBus(context.logger);

const readResult = await bus.run(
  new ReadArchiveCommand(verseSource),
  { route, fragments: [] },
);

const bindResult = await bus.run(
  new BindIndexCommand(context.codex.index),
  readResult,
);

const proof = context.proof.seal({
  commandTrace: bus.getTrace(),
});
```

!! 与技能触发的关系

命令轨迹支持可选效果`commandMustBeReplayable`。平台可以重放命令序列验证一致性，配方检查的是轨迹完整度和可复现性。

